      "writtenOn": "2023-09-07T02:49:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It doesn\u0027t need to be a OnceCallback. Callers of this function might pass in a RepeatingCallback and use the returned Callback multiple times. Before that possibility is excluded, I think it\u0027s safer to keep it as it is.",
      "parentUuid": "e45ba8cb_7f260951",
